    "title": "The 19th Annual Antique Engine & Tractor Show - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Opinions ,\n1 days ago What is the 19th Annual Antique Engine & Tractor Show?. The Gordon County Antique Engine and Tractor Club, is a two- day event on October 17-18 celebrating agricultural history with daily parades, tractor games, live demonstrations of threshing and baling, and operating steam engines. The Show takes place a Cherokee Capital Fairgrounds in Calhoun, Georgia and admission is free! Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
